{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 2, "text": "老人买来的糖果，老人总是藏着舍不得吃，几乎一次次地最后全分给幼小的儿孙们。不", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 278, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "老人买来的糖果，老人总是藏着舍不得吃，几乎一次次地最后全分给幼小的儿孙们。不", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 278, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 3, "text": "准打骂小孩的爱幼家风，甚至赋予了宗教观念：十二岁以前的孩子都被认有“十二神", "bbox_px": {"x": 104, "y": 338, "w": 1540, "h": 58}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "准打骂小孩的爱幼家风，甚至赋予了宗教观念：十二岁以前的孩子都被认有“十二神", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 104, "y": 338, "w": 1540, "h": 58}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 4, "text": "母”守护，分管孩子的各种活动，认为打骂小孩，“神母”会生气，使小孩遭受病害。为了小", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 398, "w": 1544, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "母”守护，分管孩子的各种活动，认为打骂小孩，“神母”会生气，使小孩遭受病害。为了小", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 398, "w": 1544, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 5, "text": "孩的安康，除了不准打骂外，逢年过节祭祖之后，还要专门祭供小孩的“神母”", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 463, "w": 1343, "h": 60}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "孩的安康，除了不准打骂外，逢年过节祭祖之后，还要专门祭供小孩的“神母”", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 463, "w": 1343, "h": 60}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 6, "text": "。布依族绝", "bbox_px": {"x": 1431, "y": 471, "w": 213, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "。布依族绝", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1431, "y": 471, "w": 213, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 7, "text": "对不准遗弃婴幼儿，不论男女、残疾、痴呆都如此；不准虐待，这种爱幼家风，也被赋予了", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 531, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "对不准遗弃婴幼儿，不论男女、残疾、痴呆都如此；不准虐待，这种爱幼家风，也被赋予了", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 531, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 8, "text": "宗教观念：过去，人们认为孩子的生命由花界（主管小孩灵魂的神界）传予花魂赋于胎体", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 595, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "宗教观念：过去，人们认为孩子的生命由花界（主管小孩灵魂的神界）传予花魂赋于胎体", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 595, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 9, "text": "而成，如遗弃一个，“花神”生气了不再给予花魂，导致夫妻不能生育。布依族家庭对于幼", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 660, "w": 1540, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "而成，如遗弃一个，“花神”生气了不再给予花魂，导致夫妻不能生育。布依族家庭对于幼", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 660, "w": 1540, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 10, "text": "者，无论男女，不论长相如何，都视为掌上明珠。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 732, "w": 820, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "者，无论男女，不论长相如何，都视为掌上明珠。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 732, "w": 820, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 11, "text": "布依族家风的另一大特点，就是家庭成员间互谦互让，家庭和睦。首先是儿媳与公", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 797, "w": 1455, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布依族家风的另一大特点，就是家庭成员间互谦互让，家庭和睦。首先是儿媳与公", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 797, "w": 1455, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 12, "text": "婆关系处得较好。儿媳都有“生为这家人，死为这家鬼”的观念，所以把公婆当作自己的", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 857, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "婆关系处得较好。儿媳都有“生为这家人，死为这家鬼”的观念，所以把公婆当作自己的", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 857, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 13, "text": "父母来对待。儿媳有什么难处，总先找公婆商量，小两口有点口角，公婆总先教训儿子。", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 921, "w": 1552, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "父母来对待。儿媳有什么难处，总先找公婆商量，小两口有点口角，公婆总先教训儿子。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 921, "w": 1552, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 14, "text": "媳妇与叔子、姑子、妯娌也处得较好，能大度相谦，有点争执，总用一句俗语自警：“天地几", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 986, "w": 1540, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "媳妇与叔子、姑子、妯娌也处得较好，能大度相谦，有点争执，总用一句俗语自警：“天地几", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 986, "w": 1540, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 15, "text": "万年，我们得一世。”意思是天地几万年才把我们转到一起，应该珍惜天地功德。夫妻互", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1046, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "万年，我们得一世。”意思是天地几万年才把我们转到一起，应该珍惜天地功德。夫妻互", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 1046, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 16, "text": "谦互让更不用说，平时总自谦说：“我这样丑这样笨，你不嫌弃我就满足了。“有事相商，有", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1110, "w": 1540, "h": 61}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "谦互让更不用说，平时总自谦说：“我这样丑这样笨，你不嫌弃我就满足了。“有事相商，有", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1110, "w": 1540, "h": 61}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 17, "text": "好事先让给对方，在外互相维护尊严和威望。有谁生气时，照人们常唱的几句布依山歌", "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1179, "w": 1544, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "好事先让给对方，在外互相维护尊严和威望。有谁生气时，照人们常唱的几句布依山歌", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 109, "y": 1179, "w": 1544, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 18, "text": "来谦让：", "bbox_px": {"x": 108, "y": 1243, "w": 145, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "来谦让：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 108, "y": 1243, "w": 145, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 19, "text": "女：以后来年成一双，", "bbox_px": {"x": 350, "y": 1316, "w": 370, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "女：以后来年成一双，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 350, "y": 1316, "w": 370, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 172, "line_no": 20, "text": "要是你生气——", "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1380, "w": 289, "h": 40}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "要是你生气——", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 414, "y": 1380, "w": 289, "h": 40}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
